P:03D4:clear_it: load high byte of address
P:03D6:: if it equals 1...
P:03D8:: ... skip (don't mess with stack at $0100-$01FF)
P:03E1:: decrement high byte of address
P:03E6:read_joypad: Read joypad\n ===========\n Returns: JOY_STAT = status of all buttons
P:03E8:: reset strobe
P:03EC:: clear strobe
P:03EF::sty     JOY_STAT ; JOY_STAT = 0 (clear all button bits)\n do all 8 buttons
P:03F1:read_button: load button status
P:03F4:: only keep lowest bit
P:03F6:: transfer to carry flag
P:03FD:clear_nametable: Clear nametable\n ===============\n A     : Select nametable (range 0...3)
P:03FF:: write high byte of name table address
P:0404:: write low byte of name table address
